  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4c67bea384539144a96e18f64d8cf7eb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialManager
  steps:
  - title: WELCOME TO NA-KNIGHTS
    body: You are the immune system of a human body. Over the next 14 days, infections
      will enter the bloodstream. Your job is to find them, deploy white blood cells,
      and keep the body alive.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: 
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: NAVIGATION
    body: "Drag with the RIGHT MOUSE BUTTON to pan the camera. Use the SCROLL WHEEL
      to zoom. Your job is to find infections and defend the body \u2014 get comfortable
      moving around."
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 1
    actionId: panOrZoomCamera
    targetKey: navigationFrame
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: THE WELLNESS BAR
    body: This is the body's overall health. It starts at 100. Every infection you
      clear adds points. Every infection you neglect or fail costs points. Reach
      Day 14 with wellness at 50 or higher to win.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: wellness
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: THE DAY COUNTER
    body: Each in-game day lasts about 1 minute of real time. Your run is 14 days
      long. The label at the top shows the current day and time. Reach Day 14 with
      wellness 50+ to win.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: dayCounter
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: FAST FORWARD
    body: Use the fast-forward button to speed up calm periods. Press it to cycle
      through 1x, 2x, 4x, and 6x speed. Slow back down to 1x when things get dangerous
      so you can react quickly.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: fastForward
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: HUMAN SNAPSHOT
    body: This is the human you're protecting. Routines like sleeping, eating, and
      working happen here. They can affect the body's state.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: humanSnapshot
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: CONSOLE LOG
    body: "Everything that happens in the body is logged here \u2014 infections,
      routines, random events. Watch this to know what's going on."
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: consoleLog
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: THE BODY'S LAYERS
    body: 'The body has four defense layers: Circulatory, Lymphatic, Digestive, Respiratory.
      You''ll explore each one now. Click the LAYERS header to collapse or expand
      that panel.'
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: layers
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: CIRCULATORY SYSTEM
    body: The bloodstream. Pathogens travel through here. This is where most of your
      defenses will be needed.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc84a6d8bceec06479321fd81d38f51d, type: 3}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: frameLayer2
    targetKey: layers
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: LYMPHATIC SYSTEM
    body: The body's drainage and adaptive-immune highway. Viruses and adaptive responses
      live here. (More gameplay will be added in a future update.)
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee7c8e14a4d818f4f97166613b7e81a0, type: 3}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: frameLayer1
    targetKey: layers
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: DIGESTIVE SYSTEM
    body: Your gut barrier. Food and drink enter here, and contaminated intake can
      spawn infections in the bloodstream.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6258ebc1846ad94aa8639b5106a045b, type: 3}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: frameLayer3
    targetKey: layers
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: RESPIRATORY SYSTEM
    body: Your airway barrier. Airborne pathogens can breach here during commutes
      and crowded places.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5f7d9d7c960b7a4ca15f43a2146eae2, type: 3}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: frameLayer4
    targetKey: layers
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: YOUR FIRST INFECTION
    body: 'An infection just entered the body. You''ll see two types of infections:
      bacterial (red) and viral (blue). Your job is to clear them before they drain
      the body''s wellness.'
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: spawnFirstInfection
    targetKey: notificationIcon
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: BACTERIAL VS VIRAL
    body: "BACTERIAL (RED) \u2014 Cleared directly by white blood cells via phagocytosis.
      Deploy WBCs to eliminate.\n\nVIRAL (BLUE) \u2014 Contained by WBCs, not cleared.
      The body's adaptive response takes ~2 days to resolve."
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: infectionTypes
    targetKey: 
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: PENDING INFECTIONS
    body: "Each active infection shows here. Click a row to focus the camera on that
      infection. States will change as you engage: Pending \u2192 Ongoing \u2192
      Cleared.\n\nClick the pending infection row to focus on it."
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 1
    actionId: clickPendingRow
    targetKey: pendingInfections
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: DEPLOY YOUR DEFENDERS
    body: "Click the WBC headshot to start a deployment. A prompt will ask you to
      select an infection \u2014 click the infection on the map or its panel row
      to send the squad. You can deploy up to 2 squads at a time, with a 5-second
      cooldown between deploys."
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: wbcHeadshot
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: RESOLVE AN INFECTION
    body: Now deploy a squad and clear the infection. You'll see wellness rise when
      you succeed. Click the WBC headshot, then select the pending infection to send
      your squad.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 1
    actionId: resolveInfection
    targetKey: wbcHeadshot
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: SPEED THINGS UP
    body: Now try the fast-forward button. Cycle through 1x, 2x, 4x, and 6x. Press
      it now to speed up time.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 1
    actionId: pressFastForward
    targetKey: fastForward
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: IGNORING INFECTIONS HAS A COST
    body: 'Infections that aren''t resolved escalate and drain wellness each day.
      Watch this example:'
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: applyWellnessDrop
    targetKey: wellness
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  - title: HOW TO WIN
    body: Reach Day 14 with wellness at 50 or higher to win. If wellness drops below
      50 by Day 14, you lose. If it ever reaches 0, the run ends immediately. Good
      luck, defender.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    revealTarget: {fileID: 0}
    hideTarget: {fileID: 0}
    requiresAction: 0
    actionId: 
    targetKey: dayCounter
    secondaryIcon: {fileID: 0}
    containerAnchor: 3
    highlightTarget: {fileID: 0}
  hideAllTargets: []
  highlightColor: {r: 0, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  highlightFadeInDuration: 0.6
  highlightHoldDuration: 0.2
  highlightFadeOutDuration: 0.6
  ForceShowOnEveryStart: 1
  AlwaysShowForGuest: 1
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 7662445882601576588}
  panelRect: {fileID: 1001187391737330290}
  titleLabel: {fileID: 7070247116793545824}
  bodyLabel: {fileID: 1870076257795275650}
